  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ、雛菜\r\n気の抜けた声出して",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001044010100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104401/4001044010100"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれ、そういえば\r\n今日、レッスンじゃなかったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001044010110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "午前だけね～\r\nもうとっくに終わった～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104401/4001044010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、お疲れ\r\n他のみんなはどうしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001044010120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "透先輩は追試で補習で\r\n小糸ちゃんは塾の冬季講習通うって～",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104401/4001044010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001044010130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "しばらくあるみたいだから\r\nこの冬休みは暇だな～……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104401/4001044010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだったな\r\nふたりから聞いてるよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも円香はどうしたんだ？\r\n一緒じゃないのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001044010140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "円香先輩は帰ったんじゃない～？\r\n知らないけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104401/4001044010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001044010150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜もおやつ食べたら\r\n帰ろうかな～……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104401/4001044010150"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1300
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\n雛菜、それならさ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
